BUILD A COMPLETE AI-POWERED COLLEGE CANTEEN PRE-ORDERING WEB APPLICATION — KANTRO AI

Build a complete, functional, responsive, full-stack web application named KANTRO AI.

This must be a working application with frontend, backend, database, authentication, order management, scheduling, and AI-assisted ordering. Do not create only a static UI or a landing-page prototype.

The application should be designed for a college canteen where students can check the menu, plan their food orders according to their class breaks, pre-order food, and collect it from the canteen at the scheduled time.

The kitchen employees should receive and prepare orders efficiently, while the kitchen administrator should be able to monitor and manage the entire canteen operation.

The main purpose is to reduce waiting time, prevent crowding during college breaks, improve kitchen coordination, and make food pre-ordering convenient.

