8. AI FOOD ASSISTANT — IMPORTANT FEATURE

Create an AI-powered chat assistant called:

KANTRO AI Assistant

It should help students decide what to order according to their class timetable, break time, available kitchen slots, food preferences, and preparation time.

Give the assistant a simple chat interface.

The student should be able to type natural-language questions such as:

- "I have a class at 1 PM. When can I order?"
- "My break is only 15 minutes. What can I eat?"
- "What can I order if I have only 10 minutes?"
- "Suggest something under ₹50."
- "Which food items can be prepared before my break ends?"
- "Show me the complete menu."
- "I have a class immediately after lunch. Suggest a quick meal."
- "Can I order a dosa and coffee together?"
- "What is available right now?"

The assistant should:

1. Understand the student's question.
2. Ask for missing break details when necessary.
3. Refer to actual menu items stored in the database.
4. Use the actual preparation time of each item.
5. Check current item availability.
6. Check real kitchen capacity and available pickup slots.
7. Recommend suitable items based on the student's available time and budget.
8. Suggest combinations of food items when appropriate.
9. Display prices and preparation times in its recommendations.
10. Allow the student to add a suggested item to the cart.
11. Allow the student to proceed to checkout.

Example:

Student: "I have only 10 minutes before my next class. What can I order?"

Assistant:

"You have a short break! Based on the current menu, you could consider:

- Idli — ₹30 — 5 minutes
- Tea — ₹12 — 3 minutes
- Curd Rice — ₹40 — 5 minutes

You can also check available pickup slots before confirming your order."

The assistant must not invent menu items, prices, availability, or pickup times.

AI recommendations are suggestions only. Actual order feasibility must always be checked by the backend.

If Gemini is unavailable, show useful fallback suggestions based on menu data and preparation times.

